== Trivia ==
* Maggy appeared in the original ''Binding of Isaac'', with the same unlock method.
* Magdalene's name is a reference to [[wikipedia:Mary Magdalene|Mary Magdalene]], a female follower of Jesus who witnessed his death and ressurection.
** Magdalene's unlock requirement of having seven heart containers may be a reference to the "seven demons" that were driven out of Mary Magdalene.
* Magdalene is the name of Isaac’s mother Magdalene O. Moriah, or MOM. The last name Moriah is a reference to the biblical story of Isaac where Moriah is the name of the mountain Isaac was to be sacrificed on in the Book of Genesis.
* The image file for Maggy's hair is named "maggiesbeautifulgoldenlocks.png".
* Maggy's hair appears to be identical to the wig that Isaac receives in one of his mid-floor nightmares.
** The person with gold hair in [[Ending 14]] and [[Ending 22]] has been confirmed to be Isaac wearing a wig, which furthers this idea.
** Another piece of evidence is that the four playable female characters all have Isaac's voice.
* Maggy's locked icon shows her bound in chains.
** She shares this trait with {{C|Cain}}, {{C|Samson}}, {{C|Eve}}, {{C|Lazarus}}, {{C|Bethany|r}}, and {{C|Jacob and Esau|r}}.

